---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Partner terms | European Scrap Market"
  description="Terms for scrap yards partnering with European Scrap Market. Verification, payment, lead acceptance, and safety commitments."
>

<div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-12 sm:px-8">
  <p class="mono" data-reveal>LEGAL</p>
  <h1 class="display h-section mt-3" data-reveal>Partner <span class="grad-text">terms</span></h1>

  <div class="prose mt-8 max-w-none space-y-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-muted)]" data-reveal>
    <h2 class="display text-lg font-bold text-[var(--color-ink)]">1. Verification</h2>
    <p>Every partner yard must provide valid company registration, tax status, and environmental permit or waste transport registration for their country of operation. European Scrap Market verifies these manually before activating the account.</p>

    <h2 class="display text-lg font-bold text-[var(--color-ink)]">2. Payment per lead</h2>
    <p>Partners pay €299 per accepted lead. Accepting a lead unlocks the seller's contact details. If a lead is invalid or unreachable, contact support within 48 hours for a credit. There is no monthly subscription.</p>

    <h2 class="display text-lg font-bold text-[var(--color-ink)]">3. Traceable payment</h2>
    <p>Partners commit to traceable payment methods only — bank transfer or documented settlement. Cash payments are not permitted within the network.</p>

    <h2 class="display text-lg font-bold text-[var(--color-ink)]">4. ID verification</h2>
    <p>Partners verify the identity of sellers at pickup. For high-value batches, both parties exchange documented proof of transaction.</p>

    <h2 class="display text-lg font-bold text-[var(--color-ink)]">5. Documentation</h2>
    <p>Partners provide settlement notes and correct waste documentation for all transactions. For industrial and commercial sellers, this includes waste transfer notes and certificates of disposal as required by local law.</p>

    <h2 class="display text-lg font-bold text-[var(--color-ink)]">6. One yard per case</h2>
    <p>Only one partner may accept a case at a time. The seller decides whether to do business. If the seller declines or is not contacted, the case is released for another partner to accept.</p>

    <h2 class="display text-lg font-bold text-[var(--color-ink)]">7. Conduct</h2>
    <p>Partners must conduct themselves professionally and transparently. Misrepresentation of prices, harassment of sellers, or violation of these terms may result in immediate account suspension.</p>

    <h2 class="display text-lg font-bold text-[var(--color-ink)]">8. Data</h2>
    <p>Partner contact details and lead data are handled in accordance with GDPR. See our Privacy Policy for details.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-8 rounded-lg border border-amber-300 bg-amber-50 px-4 py-3 text-sm text-amber-800" data-reveal>
    <strong>Placeholder:</strong> These are draft terms for the first version. Final legal terms should be reviewed by a qualified lawyer before going live.
  </div>
</div>

</Layout>
